sequenceDiagram
    participant PLC as S7-1500 PLC
    participant EDGE as NVIDIA edge service
    participant CAM as Camera/lighting
    participant HMI as WinCC Unified
    PLC->>PLC: Freeze session, ID, recipe, expected identities
    PLC->>EDGE: INSPECTION_TRIGGER=1 with immutable request
    EDGE->>EDGE: Validate schema, identity, health and queue
    EDGE->>CAM: Trigger/acquire using configured exposure
    CAM-->>EDGE: Frame bound to session/inspection ID
    EDGE-->>PLC: CAPTURE_ACK + PROCESSING_STATE
    EDGE->>EDGE: Preprocess, infer, postprocess, policy checks
    EDGE-->>PLC: Write complete result payload
    EDGE-->>PLC: RESULT_VALID=1 last
    PLC->>PLC: Verify ID/session/age/model/dataset/calibration/result
    alt Exact valid PASS
        PLC-->>HMI: PASS diagnostic; PLC may authorize transfer
    else HOLD/FAIL/FAULT/uncertain
        PLC-->>HMI: HOLD with first-out reason and disposition
    end
    PLC-->>EDGE: Exact RESULT_ACK_ID
    EDGE-->>PLC: Clear RESULT_VALID; preserve audit record
    Note over PLC,EDGE: Disconnect/restart cannot reuse a prior-session result.
